DECLARE Person IS ONE OF Buyer, Seller
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF pay

GIVETH A DEONTIC Person Action
rent MEANS PARTY Buyer MUST pay WITHIN 7 HENCE FULFILLED LEST BREACH

-- the clock is advanced to 8 by an event of a party the rule does not constrain
#TRACE rent AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Seller DOES pay AT 8

#TRACE rent AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Seller DOES pay AT 3
